{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Both policies{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <h1>A manager <em>and</em> the owner</h1>
    <p>
        <code>{{ document.title }}</code> is owned by <code>{{ document.owner }}</code>, and you
        passed both halves of the <code>#[All]</code>: the role and the <code>EDIT</code> attribute
        on this document.
    </p>
    <p class="muted">
        <code>All</code> stops at the first refusal and hands back that policy's own outcome, so the
        403 says which half failed rather than that "something" did.
    </p>
{% endblock %}
